      "text": "  rule filterBody()\n    => If(\n         Compare(Name(\"num\"), CmpOp(\">\", Int(10))),\n         Assign(Name(\"text\"), Call(Name(\"str\"), Name(\"num\")))\n         If(\n           Compare(\n             BinOp(\n               \"%\",\n               Call(Name(\"ord\"), Subscript(Name(\"text\"), Int(0))),\n               Int(2)),\n             CmpOp(\"==\", Int(1))),\n           If(\n             Compare(\n               BinOp(\n                 \"%\",\n                 Call(\n                   Name(\"ord\"),\n                   Subscript(Name(\"text\"), UnaryOp(\"-\", Int(1)))),\n                 Int(2)),\n               CmpOp(\"==\", Int(1))),\n             AugAssign(Name(\"count\"), \"+\", Int(1)),\n             .Stmts),\n           .Stmts),\n         .Stmts)"
